    description: "Found by the 2026-10-31 docstring staleness audit (dev 5f6b2af921): a reviewer flagged it and a default-REJECT verifier re-reproduced it on a fixture of its own (reports under ~/hypergumbo_lab_notebook/staleness_audit_10312026/review and verify). Corpus impact not measured. circom.py:409 resolver.lookup(ref_name) though stable_ids scope signals by template (102-106, 232). Templates A and B each with out <== in: A's constraint references B's in/out; A's own get no edge. v10."  # efc8
